abstract: >-
  MATLAB toolbox for the time-domain random-vibration analysis of linear and
  equivalent-linearised Bouc-Wen SDOF systems under filtered,
  amplitude-modulated Gaussian seismic excitation, via the evolutionary
  Lyapunov covariance equation. Returns covariance histories, first-passage
  peak estimates and mean energy histories. Released together with the
  v2.3-beta technical manual, which also documents features planned for
  later code versions.
